From 66fdc2d6596aaf222b16eadb0621faf326cecf30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Siju Karunakran <karunakaran.siju@heb.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 20:22:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add unified state-based navigation with NavigationDomain

- Introduce NavigationDomain owning all navigation state: selected tab,
  per-tab NavigationStack paths (homeStack, browseStack), and modal sheets
  (login, shoppingListFlow)
- Add AppDestination enum for typed push routes shared by Home/Browse tabs
- Remove productDetail and shoppingListFlow state from HomeDomain, BrowseDomain,
  ShoppingListDomain and SharedShoppingListDomain adapter
- Feature domains emit delegate actions; AppDomain bridges to NavigationDomain
- HomeView and BrowseView use NavigationStack(path:) with .navigationDestination
  for ProductDetailView (now data/callback-driven, no internal store)
- AppRootView drives TabView, login sheet, and shopping list flow sheet from
  NavigationDomain state
- Add .onOpenURL deep link handler parsing layout:// scheme
- Add NavigationDomainTests covering tab switching, stack ops, modals, and URL parsing

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
