Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Drive NavigationStack paths from feature store bindings

Remove @Binding parameters from HomeView and BrowseView.
Add navigationPath to HomeState/BrowseState and setNavigationPath
actions so views bind via store.binding(state:action:).
AppDomain bridges home/browse(.setNavigationPath) back to
navigation.homeStack/browseStack, and the .navigation catch-all
syncs stacks into feature states for deep-link propagation.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
